harness_limitations[3]: "-C is supplied to both jq and tq so color bytes are emitted through redirected stdin/stdout; this does not assert terminal auto-detection behavior.",The fixture uses one compact object containing all eight documented slots; raw-byte comparison verifies escape sequences while preserving the jq/tq JQ_COLORS mismatch.,"NO_COLOR is explicitly set to an empty string and JQ_COLORS is always supplied, avoiding inherited host color settings."
